    {
      "id": "f_text_103",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 40,
      "y": 812,
      "width": 896,
      "height": 50,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#495057",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 12249,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 1,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1792512000000,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "① STALE = when 为 false 且引用了 stale/absent 信号；FALSE = 值层面为假。二者严格区分，是「L2 没手感」类排障的第一分叉点。\n② hold 是 latch（真值区间内每 tick 续期 until），不是 cooldown；cooldown 仅 speak / radio 生效，扳机规则显示 n/a。\n③ release 每 tick 阶梯衰减；Scaled 只缩放 forceParams，不改 release 包络几何。三态 / 逐节点 AST / provider 归因均依赖 §5.1 与 §5.3 新增遥测，标 backend pending。",
      "originalText": "① STALE = when 为 false 且引用了 stale/absent 信号；FALSE = 值层面为假。二者严格区分，是「L2 没手感」类排障的第一分叉点。\n② hold 是 latch（真值区间内每 tick 续期 until），不是 cooldown；cooldown 仅 speak / radio 生效，扳机规则显示 n/a。\n③ release 每 tick 阶梯衰减；Scaled 只缩放 forceParams，不改 release 包络几何。三态 / 逐节点 AST / provider 归因均依赖 §5.1 与 §5.3 新增遥测，标 backend pending。",
      "fontSize": 10,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.65
    }
  ],
